</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Worthy of the sweetest praise</l><l>That my ransomed heart can raise,</l><l>Is that Man in whom alone</l><l>God Himself is fully known.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For those clust’ring glories prove</l><l>That glad gospel, “God is Love,”</l><l>Whilst those wounds, in glory bright.</l><l>Voice the solemn, “God is Light.”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Hark, my soul! thy Savior sings;</l><l>Catch the joy that music brings,</l><l>And, with that sweet flood of song,</l><l>Pour thy whisp’ring praise along.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O my Savior, glorified,</l><l>Turn my eye from all beside,</l><l>Let me but Thy beauty see,</l><l>Other light is dark to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
